{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "十秒？那该不会是十秒后，我连伞都忘了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.802, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 322, "total_tokens": 368, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "够不够？我这就把伞递给你，你拿我当你的零花钱。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.208, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 386, "total_tokens": 434, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哪能，那才是我故意让风刮的。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.422, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 320, "total_tokens": 362, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "哼，那首得靠你帮我把歌词编成歌。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.419, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 382, "total_tokens": 427, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "木勺归你，玻璃杯归我，那两样东西我帮你装进后备箱。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.346, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 318, "total_tokens": 368, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "我拿你的木勺，玻璃杯我帮你装进后备箱，拍子你拿我的伞。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.296, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 52, "prompt_tokens": 392, "total_tokens": 444, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台上那堆旧箱子，我替你把它们装进新箱子。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.967, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 323, "total_tokens": 369, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "云得先打雷，我帮你把箱子顶到屋顶。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.617, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 391, "total_tokens": 436, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "那路我帮你绕，下次再让我多管闲事。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.541, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 323, "total_tokens": 367, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "我帮你找，你猜哪条路？", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.226, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 384, "total_tokens": 425, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，谁在说，", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 4.593, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 150, "prompt_tokens": 325, "total_tokens": 475, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，请假的，", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 3.611, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 131, "prompt_tokens": 491, "total_tokens": 622, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁没注意？我特意把扣子亮着，怕大家猜错我是不是装傻。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.512, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "prompt_tokens": 320, "total_tokens": 371, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "名字得叫‘小亮’，不然扣子会亮得比人还亮。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.308, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 392, "total_tokens": 442, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哪能啊，你才想让我帮你把伞收好，我这就去。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.344, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 319, "total_tokens": 367, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "行，我这就把伞递给你，你坐这儿看。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.083, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 387, "total_tokens": 432, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
